  "What is Skill Registry?": "Skill Registry l\u00e0 g\u00ec?",
  "Skill Registry is a versioned, immutable catalog for skills imported from approved sources.": "Skill Registry l\u00e0 danh m\u1ee5c b\u1ea5t bi\u1ebfn, c\u00f3 phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n cho c\u00e1c skill nh\u1eadp t\u1eeb ngu\u1ed3n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00ea duy\u1ec7t.",
  "How the workflow works": "Quy tr\u00ecnh ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng",
  "A source is connected to Git Manager or Skill Hub. Sync discovers SKILL.md files and creates candidates. A ready candidate can be published as an immutable version, then downloaded through the public catalog API.": "Ngu\u1ed3n k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u1edbi Git Manager ho\u1eb7c Skill Hub. Sync t\u00ecm SKILL.md v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o candidate. Candidate ready c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 publish th\u00e0nh phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n b\u1ea5t bi\u1ebfn, sau \u0111\u00f3 t\u1ea3i qua API catalog.",
  "Source": "Ngu\u1ed3n", "Candidate": "Candidate", "Catalog API": "API catalog",
  "Instruction-only": "Ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn",
